  "question": "Where is gallery situated within 90 kilometers along the travel path toward All Saints Way, Boston, MA from Cyrus Dallin Art Museum, Arlington, MA?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-71.15241 42.415769)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-71.052501 42.366341)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE tourism = 'gallery'\nAND ST_DWithin(pois.geometry, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-71.15241 42.415769)',4326)::geography, 90000)\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-71.15241 42.415769)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5);\n",
